      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it sounds like a really messy situation. you mentioned that the British refusal to implement a power-sharing formula \"forced the hand\" of the different groups. can you explain the British perspective on that? like, what were the specific challenges or constraints they were facing that made finding a power-sharing agreement so difficult for them?",
